('lovers', 4, 'What fear about us have you been carrying without telling me?', '¿Qué miedo sobre nuestra relación has cargado sin contármelo?'),
('lovers', 4, 'What is the most hurt you have ever felt because of me?', '¿Cuál es el dolor más grande que yo te he causado?'),
